# Input
```cjs
delete a.b;
```

# Diagnostics
```
invalid.jsonc:1:1 lint/performance/noDelete  FIXABLE  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  ! Avoid the delete operator.
  
  > 1 │ delete a.b;
      │ ^^^^^^^^^^
  
  i Deleting a property changes the shape of the object, which can prevent JavaScript engines from optimizing code that uses it.
  
  i Unsafe fix: Use an undefined assignment instead.
  
  - delete·a.b;
  + a.b·=·undefined;
  

```

